  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- 2026/9/19 Undo/Redo fixes: undo history now keeps the most recent edits when the 200-entry limit is exceeded (previously kept the oldest), RemoveLines undo restores removed content even when the document becomes empty, single-line document is preserved after RemoveLines\n      - 2026/9/19 Markdown highlighter fixes: fenced code blocks now match across lines (missing Singleline), headings no longer swallow the next line, inline code no longer spans lines, images no longer double-styled as links, italic no longer fires on math asterisks (2 * 3 * 4)\n      - 2026/9/19 Assembly version now matches the NuGet package (was 0.0.0.0); xunit regression test suite added (FastColoredTextBox.Tests)\n      - 2026/9/19 Reliability: GDI brush leaks on language switch fixed, Ruler disposes event subscriptions, SaveToFile safe for empty documents and on write failure, EncodingDetector uses ReadExactly and no longer returns obsolete UTF-7, iterative Undo/Redo (no stack overflow on long autoUndo chains), Text/Length newline consistency, compiled regex caching for highlighting and auto-indent\n      - 2026/9/11 Added native Markdown syntax highlighting (Language.Markdown) with bold+color heading levels, inline code, fenced code blocks with border, blockquotes, strikethrough, links, images, lists, and HR\n      - 2026/9/7 Horizontal scrolling right: text no longer slides over the line number area; CJK lines now position the first visible char by actual char widths (no left gap)\n      - 2026/9/3 Undo/Redo core logic refactored (position accuracy, cross-line support)\n      - Column selection mode IndexOutOfRangeException fixed\n      - Default padding (2px) matches WinForms TextBox\n      - Localization support for Find/Replace/GoTo/Hotkeys forms (EN/ZH)\n      - Chinese labels shortened to match English width\n      - Label z-order fixed (no longer overlaps controls)\n      - Redo shortcut changed to Ctrl+Y (standard Windows convention)\n      - .NET 10.0 support added\n      - 2026/7/23 \"Select all\" problem when evaluating text property/修正设置Text属性全选问题\n      - 2025/12/22 Wordwrap bug fix/修复换行错误\n      - CJKL mix wordwrapping almost perfect/中日韩拉丁字母混合换行基本完美\n      - Targeting NET7.0-10.0\n      - Restructed the code and minor optimization",
